Quantized source: mlx-community/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507-4bit, revision 50d427756c6b1b2fe0c0a10f67fbda1fc8e82c1b.
Changes: retain four-bit affine weights with group size 64; cast floating-point norms, scales and quantization biases to float16; deterministically repack into WebGPU buffers and split files into at most 16 MiB parts. No fine tuning. Model and tokenizer integrity hashes are in manifest.json.
